  "description": " Just getting started in the world of frames.  Took awhile to upload the required programs and version changes needed for compatibility between npm and node.  Although this is a template frame, I do want to customize frames in social for the purpose of promoting my home kitchen and blockchain validation of the ESG aspects of my local ingredient suppliers.",
  "how_its_made": "This project used an open source frame program.  Found the source on topframes.xyz\nI used npm, node, hono, frog, Airstack running Warpcast.\nAlso used Powershell since I have a Windows computer.\nReally enjoyed how easy it was to use the instructions for loading the frog demo.\nAfter viewing my frame at http://localhost:5173/ I took a picture of it and posted it on the Frames category in Warpcast.  Spent all my credits to post in Frames but it was worth it.\n\n",
